check assertR4_2 for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request
check assertR4_2b_neg for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request
check assertR4_3 for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request
check assertEmergencyLiveness for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request

// -- END OF MODEL --

// [EVENT]: Refactored all quantified formulas into facts, predicates, or assertions with complete blocks.
