// [EVENT]: Wrapped all quantified implications in parentheses to fix syntax errors.
// [EVENT]: All run/check commands use only root/top-level sigs in scope directives.
// [EVENT]: All scenario-dependent cardinality constraints are in predicates (e.g., R1Scope) instead of facts.
