// [EVENT]: Moved 'open util/ordering[ClearanceLevel] as ClearanceOrd' to file top to resolve Alloy 6 syntax error.
// [LESSON]: Can't use sum over Boolean in Alloy → Only sum integer-valued expressions
// [LESSON]: Can't use > or >= on enums/atoms (e.g., ClearanceLevel) → Must define total order with util/ordering and use lt/lte predicates
// [EVENT]: All run and check scopes refer only to top-level/root signatures, never subset sigs (Administrator)
// [EVENT]: Wrapped each quantified implication/fact in parentheses to avoid syntax errors from top-level 'and'
